6,MUSIC IN TIBET | Facts and Details,https://factsanddetails.com/china/cat6/sub36/item206.html,Their songs and music are well-modulated in tone and the words fit well with the tunes.The areas inhabited by Tibetans boasts a great diversity of folk songs and dances. Some musical instruments were introduced from the interior of China. Long-handled drums and trumpets are the main musical instruments used by the lamas.,Phuza,Sino-Tibetan
